  "source_text": "When this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard, select 1 monster with an ATK of 1500 or less from your Deck, show it to your opponent, and add it to your hand. Then shuffle your Deck.",
  "notes": [
    "Demonstrates a public-zone trigger, a filtered deck search, a reveal and a shuffle."
  ],
  "scripts": [
